flowchart TB
    accTitle: Brook bounded context
    accDescr: Retained history supports protected exact evidence, a recent tail and extensible historical representations or retrieval. Host validation assembles bounded context without requiring all history.
    history["Retained history + current facts<br/>Separate retention policy"]
    exact["Protected exact evidence<br/>Call / receipt / outcome"]
    recent["Recent tail<br/>Current session activity"]
    extension["Compaction / retrieval<br/>Coverage + authorized sources"]
    context["Host-validated bounded context<br/>Required evidence must fit"]
    run["Fresh agent invocation<br/>Current revision + cancellation"]
    history --> exact
    history --> recent
    history --> extension
    exact --> context
    recent --> context
    extension --> context
    context --> run
